			"notes": "-Added new structure: Ancient Bridge\n-Added infused soul sand (used to produce soul lava)\n-Added item pedestal\n-Added soul infuser\n-Added soul compactor\n-Added alchemixer\n-Added spirited iron ingot, tools and armor\n-Added grapplin hook\n-Added soul harvesting enchantment and soul fragments\n-Added floating walkways\n-Changed soul furnace behaviour (now smelt 4 stacks at once)\n-Removed most opal blocks\n-Removed opal crystals\n-Lava goggles can now be dyed like leather armor\n-Riptide can now be used when inside water cauldrons\n-Allays can be duplicated using echo shards\n-Updated some textures\n-Lot of bugfixes"
		},
